# ----- Reference papers (not versioned; keep local copies only) -----
# Per user direction: PDFs of cited papers are intentionally NOT pushed to
# the repository. Use the arXiv URL in README / spec citations instead.
*.pdf
docs/*.pdf

# ----- Project-specific data, results, checkpoints (per spec 60/80/90) -----
# These directories will be created at implementation stage and contain
# generated artefacts (datasets, training outputs, reports). They are NOT
# part of the spec / source-code release artefact.
data/
results/
results/test_reports/
debug/
checkpoints/
/models/
final_report.md
assets/

# ----- Study-line organization (post-migration) -----
# studies/: research-line subtree. Only per-line reports/drafts docs are
# versioned; heavy artefacts (data under it) are ignored.
studies/
archive/
!studies/
# 保留研究线下的文档（报告/草稿），忽略其数据与大产物
!studies/line1_substitute_sr/
!studies/line1_substitute_sr/reports/
!studies/line1_substitute_sr/drafts/
!studies/line1_substitute_sr/drafts/**
!studies/line1_substitute_sr/results/assets/**

# ----- line2 anchor（用户批准入库：spec line2/10 [S1]）-----
!studies/line2_particle_sr/
!studies/line2_particle_sr/data/
!studies/line2_particle_sr/data/anchor/
!studies/line2_particle_sr/data/anchor/injector.sdds

# ----- line2 交付文档（沿 line1 先例：每线 reports 文档入库）-----
# 实验报告与域地图是 `40` [S4] 的交付物；重产物（*.h5/*.ckpt/results 运行目录）仍被上面的
# results/ 与扩展名规则排除。注：`results/assets/**` 无法白名单化（父目录 results/ 先被
# 排除后不能重新包含），与 AGENTS.md「assets 不入库」一致，故图落盘于 reports/ 下随报告入库。
!studies/line2_particle_sr/reports/
!studies/line2_particle_sr/reports/**
# 白名单会覆盖文件顶部 __pycache__/ 规则，故在报告目录下显式排除字节码
studies/line2_particle_sr/reports/**/__pycache__/

# ----- Heavy artefacts that should never be committed -----
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.pkl
*.parquet

